WEBVTT

00:24:27.990 --> 00:24:30.278
Suppose you had the following two choices, right?

00:24:30.278 --> 00:24:33.084
You could view what he did

00:24:33.084 --> 00:24:34.978
as fundamentally a reckless act

00:24:34.978 --> 00:24:38.197
that has endangered America

00:24:38.197 --> 00:24:41.760
or you could view it as fundamentally a heroic act

00:24:41.760 --> 00:24:45.235
that will work towards America and the world's

00:24:45.235 --> 00:24:46.622
long-term good?

00:24:46.622 --> 00:24:49.940
Those are the two choices I'll give you.

00:24:49.940 --> 00:24:52.095
I'm curious to see who's willing to vote with

00:24:52.095 --> 00:24:53.512
the first of those,

00:24:53.512 --> 00:24:56.921
that this was a reckless act?

00:24:56.921 --> 00:24:58.576
There are some hands going up.

00:24:58.576 --> 00:24:59.960
Some hands going up.

00:24:59.960 --> 00:25:01.236
It's hard to put your hand up